---
import ContentPage from "@/layouts/ContentPage.astro";
import Prose from "@/components/ui/Prose.astro";

const updated = "1 September 2026";
---

<ContentPage
  title="Terms of Service"
  description="The terms that govern your use of ghorebose.com and the purchase of AI tools on the marketplace."
  crumb="Terms"
  updated={updated}
>
  <Prose>
    <p>
      These Terms of Service ("Terms") govern your access to and use of
      ghorebose.com (the "Marketplace"). By creating an account or purchasing a
      tool, you agree to these Terms.
    </p>

    <h2>1. The Marketplace</h2>
    <p>
      ghorebose.com is a marketplace that lists and facilitates the purchase of
      access to third-party AI tools. We are not the developer of the tools
      listed. Tool names and logos belong to their respective owners.
    </p>

    <h2>2. Accounts</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>You must provide accurate information when creating an account.</li>
      <li>You are responsible for keeping your password secure.</li>
      <li>You must be at least 18 years old, or have guardian consent, to purchase.</li>
      <li>One person may not maintain multiple accounts to abuse promotions.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>3. Orders and payment</h2>
    <p>
      All prices are shown in Bangladeshi Taka (৳). Payment is made via bKash,
      Nagad or Rocket. Orders are only fulfilled after our admin team verifies
      the submitted transaction. Submitting a false or reused transaction ID is
      a violation of these Terms and may result in account suspension.
    </p>

    <h2>4. Delivery</h2>
    <p>
      Access is delivered digitally to your dashboard, usually within 30 minutes
      of verification. You are responsible for keeping your access credentials
      confidential and for complying with the tool provider's terms.
    </p>

    <h2>5. Refunds</h2>
    <p>
      Refunds are governed by our <a href="/refund-policy">Refund Policy</a>,
      which forms part of these Terms.
    </p>

    <h2>6. Acceptable use</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Do not resell, share or sublicense purchased access without permission.</li>
      <li>Do not use the Marketplace for unlawful purposes.</li>
      <li>Do not attempt to disrupt or reverse engineer the Marketplace.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>7. Suspension and termination</h2>
    <p>
      We may suspend or terminate accounts that violate these Terms, abuse
      promotions, or submit fraudulent payments. Where a violation occurs, no
      refund is owed for delivered access.
    </p>

    <h2>8. Limitation of liability</h2>
    <p>
      To the maximum extent permitted by law, ghorebose.com is not liable for
      indirect or consequential losses arising from the use of third-party tools.
      Our total liability for any order is limited to the amount you paid for
      that order.
    </p>

    <h2>9. Changes to these Terms</h2>
    <p>
      We may update these Terms from time to time. Continued use of the
      Marketplace after changes take effect constitutes acceptance of the
      updated Terms.
    </p>

    <h2>10. Contact</h2>
    <p>
      Questions about these Terms? Email
      <a href="mailto:support@ghorebose.com">support@ghorebose.com</a>.
    </p>
  </Prose>
</ContentPage>
